    <description>Record-Triggered Flow on Account (After Save, Update only). Fires on every Account update with no field-specific entry filter — the watched-Account-field diff happens inside the two Apex actions (TouchLevelEvaluatorAction / CaseCreationRuleEvaluatorAction), not here, so a new "Account.&lt;field&gt;" condition never requires this Flow's entry criteria to be updated. Calls TouchLevelAccountReevaluationAction first (so Opportunity.Touch_Level__c is fresh), then CaseCreationAccountReevaluationAction, for every open Opportunity on the changed Account.</description>
